            <title>0.15.42</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 13:09:15 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>203</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.42</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Starting a recording no longer aborts with a &quot;couldn&#x27;t start recording (-10868)&quot; error when a Bluetooth headset&#x27;s mic is in a finicky state (e.g. AirPods mid-connection or with one earbud). Corder now falls back to the built-in mic and records instead of failing outright.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
